& [Problem] direct fixture authoring or fuzzing can hide multiple changes lose token identity create impossible typed evidence and smuggle expectations into generated data
& [Rejected1] generic JSON mutation for numeric boundaries because native Value conversion can lose or reject exact tokens
& [Rejected2] parse-reserialize metamorphic controls because unrelated spellings and order can change
& [Rejected3] mutate canonical schemas inside the public-root corpus because profile proof and instance conformance are different identities
& [Rejected4] accept generator-predicted verdicts because construction logic is not expectation authority
& [Rejected5] claim greedy set cover is globally minimal because it is only deterministic review-load advice
& [Rejected6] permit multi-field opaque mutants because causal attribution disappears
& [Selected] carrier-typed one-primary-change operators exact successor lineage separate expectation review immutable schemas and advisory traced selection
& [Reason] this produces inspectable compact witness proposals without turning generation into hidden inference or authority
& [Disposition] is formation_justified_generation_not_justified
